DISCLAIMER:

This software is provided for educational and research purposes. While every
effort has been made to implement cryptographic best practices, this software
has not undergone a formal security audit. For critical applications requiring
high security, please use well-established and audited solutions such as
Signal, Wire, or similar.

The authors and contributors are not responsible for any damages, data loss,
or security breaches resulting from the use of this software.

CRYPTOGRAPHIC NOTICE:

This software includes cryptographic functionality. Some countries may have
restrictions on the import, possession, use, and/or re-export of encryption
software. Users are responsible for compliance with local laws and regulations.

SECURITY:

- Always verify public keys through an out-of-band channel
- Use strong, unique passwords for key derivation
- Regularly rotate encryption keys
- Keep the software updated
- Report security vulnerabilities responsibly

For more information, see SECURITY.md
